# Snake and Rhino in the Sketch: Space past the title and controls page; in the
# sketchbook the characters move with Q W E / A S D (isometric directions) and
# Space switches between them.
14s   SPACE 5 every 100 until 26s
30s   D     30 every 120 until 70s
31s   E     30 every 120 until 70s
32s   S     30 every 120 until 70s
